phones to talk with family in other places." After verifying the Hitu words' usage and authenticity, I thought of another option that explicitly included "teknologi". I constructed this sentence: "Ira paka teknologi baru ma tulung ira kareja lei aman." Meaning "They use new technology to help them work in the village." Finally, I checked the spelling and meaning of all the Hitu words I decided to use, to see that they are all valid and make the most sense. The final sentence is: "Ira paka teknologi baru ma tulung ira kareja lei aman."


